ent is anonymous: ","type":"text"},{"code":"properties","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" holds","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"$process_person_profile: false","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so PostHog makes no person profile, and ","type":"text"},{"code":"$geoip_disable: true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so PostHog doesn’t add a location from the request’s IP address. A record with no session (one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracked by a tracker without ","type":"text"},{"code":"Enricher.sessions()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", or one a store recovered after a relaunch,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which keeps no context) is its own anonymous person, linked to nothing: PostHog rejects a whole","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"batch when one of its events has no ","type":"text"},{"code":"distinct_id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". PostHog counts a person per ","type":"text"},{"code":"distinct_id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so its unique users are sessions. The session is also sent as ","type":"text"},{"code":"$session_id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which PostHog’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sessions and web analytics group events by (","type":"text"},{"code":"SessionKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the UUIDv7 they require); a record","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with no session has none. The record’s vendor identifier and trace context, and any other","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"context value, aren’t sent.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Properties are read from the event’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"BinaryCodable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" form, which ","type":"text"},{"code":"@Event","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" derives, through the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"types its schema in ","type":"text"},{"code":"plan","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" lists: a ","type":"text"},{"code":"String","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is a string; a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Bool","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" a boolean; an integer, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Double","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Float","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" a number; a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Date","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" an ISO 8601 string, as ","type":"text"},{"code":"timestamp","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is; a ","type":"text"},{"code":"UUID","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"uppercase UUID string; an array an array; and an optional’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"code":"null","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". A ","type":"text"},{"code":"Refined","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" value","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is its value. A ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Sensitive","type":"reference"},{"text":" value is never sent, whatever the record reveals: the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"property is left out, and an element of an array is ","type":"text"},{"code":"null","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". A property whose name starts with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"$","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which only a hand-written ","type":"text"},{"code":"BinaryCodable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conformance can write, or is ","type":"text"},{"code":"distinct_id","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"left out and logged at notice level, as PostHog reads those names as settings (","type":"text"},{"code":"$set","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"$process_person_profile","type":